[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0908","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0353","title":"University of Washington Pine 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Pine 4.x 邮件客户端存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者可构造恶意的 index.html 文件，当 Pine 通过 lynx 浏览器获取该文件时，会从恶意 Web 服务器下载 uudecoded 格式的恶意载荷，随后 Pine 在处理过程中执行该载荷，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，可完全控制目标系统，影响所有使用 Pine 4.x 版本的系统和用户。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0353"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32.433","remediation":"升级 Pine 至 4.21 或更高版本，该版本已修复通过 index.html 自动调用 lynx 下载并执行恶意文件的漏洞。如无法升级，在 Pine 配置中禁用 auto-html-parsing 选项，并移除或限制 Pine 对 lynx 等外部程序的调用权限，同时在邮件客户端层面禁止自动渲染 HTML 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/pine_update_announcement.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_6.html","http://www.securiteam.com/unixfocus/HHP-Pine_remote_exploit.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1247","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0353","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0353.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccp8-f5cx-4p8g/GHSA-ccp8-f5cx-4p8g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fbab718b-0c6e-49bf-a5f8-ce372a5cd908.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fbab718b-0c6e-49bf-a5f8-ce372a5cd908.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0103","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0118","title":"RedHat Linux su 登录失败日志绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 5.2 i386/6.0 中 su 程序存在日志绕过漏洞。当 su 进程在超时前被强制终止时，系统不会记录失败的密码尝试日志，导致本地攻击者可通过暴力破解方式反复尝试密码而不被审计系统发现。该漏洞降低了暴力破解的门槛，影响 Red Hat Linux 5.2 及 6.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0118"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-06-09","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 su 程序在超时前被终止时不记录失败密码的问题。如无法升级，建议使用 sudo 替代 su 进行权限切换，并启用 auditd 审计日志记录所有认证事件，同时限制本地用户登录的并发会话数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94935300520617&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19255"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0535","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0481","title":"KDE Kmail 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0481是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0481"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:49.610","remediation":"升级 KDE KMail 至最新稳定版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复；无法立即升级时，可禁用自动加载邮件附件功能，或在邮件客户端中配置过滤器拦截来自不可信发件人的带附件邮件，以防止远程攻击者通过超长文件名附件触发缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=82&date=2000-06-22&msg=00060200422401.01667%40lez","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1380","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b7ad02cdea30b1d567c45050de3359436fcc903a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0481","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/71599ef996ac7c3f46a42cd5f524fb7576cf8be7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0481.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/440b4085dc6f68870cd0bf207bbc8dd57d0fd487/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccxh-933v-rq23/GHSA-ccxh-933v-rq23.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0481.md","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/tools/cve-details/cve-details.ipynb","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5ca6b19b-34f1-46b8-a88d-7ae0ce512e95.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0390","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0373","title":"KDE kvt 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"KDE kvt 终端模拟器存在格式化字符串漏洞，由于程序在处理用户输入时未正确过滤格式化字符串参数，导致本地攻击者可通过向 kvt 程序传递特制的格式化字符串参数触发该漏洞，覆盖任意内存地址，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.x 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可提权至 root，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0373"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.897","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 1.1.2 或更高版本以修复 kvt 终端程序中的格式化字符串漏洞。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-1999:015-01 更新包；Caldera OpenLinux 用户应应用 CSSA-1999-015.0 安全补丁。临时缓解措施可移除 kvt 的 setuid root 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/kvt），限制本地普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA1999015_01.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0373","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0373.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-33jv-3p35-h2qx/GHSA-33jv-3p35-h2qx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1700/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8b470d23-25ef-40ac-9c6e-aed4ef3d2eb6.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0390.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0377","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0377.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0365","title":"Red Hat Linux /dev/pts 文件系统权限漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 在安装 /dev/pts 伪终端文件系统时设置了不安全的文件权限，导致本地用户可以向其他用户的 tty 设备写入数据。攻击者只需拥有本地用户权限，即可向其他用户的终端会话注入恶意命令或窃取会话内容，造成权限提升或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.0 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响），属于本地权限提升类漏洞。Red Hat 已发布补丁修复该权限配置错误。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0365"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33.913","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.1 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞），或应用 Red Hat 官方发布的安全补丁 RHSA-1999:029。若无法立即升级，可通过执行 `chmod 1777 /dev/pts` 修复 /dev/pts 目录权限为 1777（粘滞位），防止本地用户写入他人 tty 设备，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92877527701347&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92886009012161&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/corp/support/errata/RHSA1999014_01.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/308","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0365.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0365","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0365.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0365.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-34pq-hxpf-w27h/GHSA-34pq-hxpf-w27h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0365.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000660.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0377.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0377.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0376","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0364","title":"Red Hat Linux screen 和 rxvt 终端设备权限设置不当漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 中的 screen 和 rxvt 终端程序未正确设置 tty 设备的权限模式，导致本地攻击者可以向其他用户的终端写入数据。该漏洞允许低权限本地用户通过向其他 tty 终端发送恶意数据，实现信息干扰、会话劫持或权限提升。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊认证即可利用。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.0 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0364"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33.790","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.1 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可手动执行 `chmod 620 /dev/pts/*` 将 pts 终端权限从 crw--w--w-（全局可写）改为 crw--w----（仅属主和 tty 组可写），并在 /etc/rc.d/rc.local 中添加 `chmod 620 /dev/pts/*` 确保重启后权限正确。同时检查 screen 和 rxvt 的 suid 配置，移除不必要的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92877527701347&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92886009012161&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/corp/support/errata/RHSA1999014_01.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/309","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0364.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0364","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0364.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0364.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/65d57a0ef6a073694a585b1f3d5a9d9bbaabc83f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-86f7-6rmq-gf8v/GHSA-86f7-6rmq-gf8v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0364.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000659.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0277","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0333","title":"tcpdump Ethereal DNS解码器无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tcpdump、Ethereal（现 Wireshark）等网络抓包工具在解析 DNS 数据包时存在无限循环漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制的 DNS 报文，其中压缩指针的跳转偏移量指向自身，导致解析器在解压缩过程中陷入死循环，造成拒绝服务。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络发送单个恶意 DNS 数据包触发该漏洞，影响 tcpdump 3.4/3.5 及 Ethereal 0.8.4/0.8.5/0.8.6 等版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0333"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29.867","remediation":"升级 tcpdump 至 3.5.2 或更高版本，升级 Ethereal（现 Wireshark）至 0.8.7 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在抓包时使用过滤规则 `not dns` 临时规避，或在 DNS 解析器入口对畸形 DNS 报文进行校验拦截，避免进入解压缩循环。","status":"completed","colle