洞。远程攻击者可通过向客户端指定任意文件的完整路径名，读取目标系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Knapster 0.9 及 1.3.8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，且已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0412"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.690","remediation":"立即升级 gnapster/knapster 至已修复该漏洞的版本（参考 FreeBSD-SA-00:18 安全公告），或在客户端防火墙中限制 Napster 客户端仅允许访问 MP3 目录的出站连接。如无法升级，建议停止使用该客户端并改用其他支持文件访问控制的 Napster 兼容客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0124.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0127.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19905","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0412.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0412","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0412.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0412.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jvph-5pfg-9gfc/GHSA-jvph-5pfg-9gfc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/gnapster_get_file.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0412.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0137","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0137.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0153","title":"Microsoft Personal Web Server 远程目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft Personal Web Server（PWS）存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含特制 `../`（点点斜杠）序列的 HTTP 请求，突破路径限制读取 Web 根目录以外的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows 95/98 及 NT 4.0 系统中的 PWS 组件，攻击方式简单且危害较大。微软已在 MS99-010 安全公告中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0153"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.647","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-010 对应补丁，或升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本并使用 IIS 替代 PWS。如无法升级，可在注册表中禁用 PWS 的虚拟目录功能，或通过防火墙限制 80 端口的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/989","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000801bf780a%249ad4b2e0%240100007f%40localhost","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0153.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0153","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0153.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0153.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvx9-rq2w-m3vg/GHSA-vvx9-rq2w-m3vg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0153.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/989/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d49ed792663c6bbe758cf7f56c6f7fd7c4afcbb1/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0017","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0019","title":"Ipswitch IMail POP3 弱加密信息泄露漏洞","description":"IMail POP3 守护进程使用弱加密算法对邮件数据进行存储和传输，本地攻击者可通过分析加密强度不足的数据流或存储文件，绕过访问控制机制读取其他用户的邮件内容及敏感文件。该漏洞影响 IMail 系列版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较高，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0019"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.127","remediation":"建议升级到 Ipswitch IMail 6.0 及以上版本，该版本改进了 POP3 守护进程的认证加密机制，不再使用弱可逆加密存储密码。如无法升级，可在注册表中将 POP3 服务端口更改为非标准端口，并通过 Windows 本地安全策略限制仅允许受信任管理员账户登录服务器，阻止非授权本地用户交互式登录以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0019","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0019.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0019.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0019","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/7ddd42377be9a6b7218518cc45c52da044b527c3/2000/CVE-2000-0019.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0019.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0019.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88240/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/223a52603d6d6e3aeedaf68a49b4971f3a3db26a/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0386","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0386.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0371","title":"KDE libmediatool 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境中的 libmediatool 库存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 mediatool 处理临时文件时创建恶意的符号链接，诱使程序以当前用户权限在任意路径创建或覆盖文件，导致系统完整性受损。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地系统访问权限，且无法远程利用。CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0371"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.640","remediation":"升级 KDE libmediatool 至修复版本（Caldera OpenLinux 安全公告 CSSA-1999-005 对应补丁），或移除 libmediatool 的 setuid 权限位（chmod -s /usr/bin/mediatool），限制本地普通用户对 mediatool 临时目录的写权限，避免符号链接劫持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0371.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0371","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0371.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0371.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-r459-3gfq-8cfj/GHSA-r459-3gfq-8cfj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0371.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0386.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0381","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0381.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0367","title":"Debian GNU/Linux eterm 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 系统中 eterm 终端模拟器 0.8.8 版本存在权限许可漏洞。由于 eterm 在处理特定操作时未正确限制用户权限，本地攻击者可通过向 eterm 发送特制请求或利用其 SUID 机制提升自身权限，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0367"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.143","remediation":"立即升级 eterm 至 0.9 或更高版本，该版本已修复权限许可漏洞。如无法升级，可移除 eterm 的 setuid root 权限位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/eterm`），以消除本地提权风险，但会丢失部分终端功能。作为 Debian GNU/Linux 用户，建议升级至包含修复的完整发行版更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1999/19990218","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0367","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0367.md","