Project/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0370.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0370","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0370.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0370.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mf78-x54f-w4hm/GHSA-mf78-x54f-w4hm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1268/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0370.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3444ac82-6678-4957-9aff-221e7b183405.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0856.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0154","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0054","title":"Solution Scripts Home Free 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Solution Scripts Home Free 1.0 中的 search.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 参数中构造 `..`（点点）序列进行路径穿越，从而读取目标服务器上的任意目录列表。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，可导致敏感文件路径泄露。受影响版本为 Solution Scripts Home Free 1.0，建议用户升级或移除该脚本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0054"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.393","remediation":"Solution Scripts Home Free 已于 2000 年代初停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即删除或禁用 `cgi-bin/search.cgi` 脚本；如仍需搜索功能，可在脚本入口处添加输入过滤，拒绝包含 `../`、`..\\\\` 等路径遍历序列的 `letter` 参数；同时通过 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含路径遍历特征（如 `../`、`%2e%2e`）的请求；最终应迁移至现代受维护的 Web 应用以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/921","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19713","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0054","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0054.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0054.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmgh-66hw-7378/GHSA-xmgh-66hw-7378.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0054.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/921/info.html","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/homefree.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0688","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0005","title":"HP-UX aserver 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统的 aserver 程序存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接文件诱导 aserver 程序以高权限访问目标文件，从而实现对系统文件的非授权读写操作。该漏洞允许拥有本地账户的攻击者获取 root 权限，完全控制系统。受影响版本包括 HP-UX 9000 系列等多个版本，需安装厂商补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0005"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48.357","remediation":"立即升级 HP-UX 至最新支持的版本，或安装 aserver 补丁 PHSS_20000（1999年12月发布）。如无法升级，移除 aserver 的 setuid 权限：`chmod u-s /opt/audio/bin/aserver`，并限制非授权用户对 /tmp 目录的写访问权限，防止 symlink 攻击滥用。同时监控 /tmp 目录的可疑符号链接创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5635","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0005","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0005.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0005.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2529-cmp4-x7vg/GHSA-2529-cmp4-x7vg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1928/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c